quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.title=A Conversation with Nia
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.description=Nia needs a few sturdy sticks for repairs and has provisions to spare for a traveler willing to help.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.objective.gather_sticks=Bring Nia 4 sticks.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.objective.give_sticks_to_nia=Give Nia the 4 sticks.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.journal.10=Nia asked me to bring her a few sticks for repairs.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.journal.20=I gathered the sticks Nia requested and should hand them over.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.offer=The storm cracked my roof beam, and I've not a stick of wood left. Four sturdy ones would set it right - could you find them for me?
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.more=Any dry stick will do. The copse east of the well is thick with fallen branches.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.accept=I'll fetch them.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.decline=Not just now.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.progress=Still looking? Four will do it - no more than that.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.handIn=Oh, bless you. That's the roof safe before the next rain.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.handOver=Here are your sticks.
quest.losttales.tutorial.meet_nia.dialogue.leave=Take care, Nia.

quest.losttales.tutorial.cheese_cache.title=The Cheese Cache
quest.losttales.tutorial.cheese_cache.description=A roadside cheese cache is running short of grain. Leave a little wheat and take provisions for the road.
quest.losttales.tutorial.cheese_cache.objective.gather_wheat=Gather 3 wheat for the cache.
quest.losttales.tutorial.cheese_cache.journal.10=The cheese cache needs a little extra wheat before it can be shared.

quest.losttales.tutorial.starter_note.title=The Sealed Note
quest.losttales.tutorial.starter_note.description=A sealed note carries a simple warning for the road: make light before dusk finds you unprepared.
quest.losttales.tutorial.starter_note.objective.craft_torches=Craft 4 torches.
quest.losttales.tutorial.starter_note.journal.10=The note asks me to craft a torch before nightfall.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.title=Path of the Survivalist: First Sparks
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.description=The first lesson of the trail is simple: gather what the land gives freely and keep a flame ready before dusk.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.objective.gather_logs=Gather 4 logs.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.objective.gather_sticks=Gather 8 sticks.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.objective.craft_torches=Craft 8 torches.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.journal.10=I have taken my first steps on the survivalist path. Before I can call myself prepared, I need simple fuel, a few branches, and a reliable flame.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.first_sparks.journal.20=I have gathered the makings of a small camp. With torches in hand, night should be less threatening.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.title=Path of the Survivalist: Stone and Shelter
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.description=A traveler who relies only on wood will not last long. Stone tools, storage, and a fire-safe hearth make a camp worth keeping.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.objective.gather_cobblestone=Gather 16 cobblestone.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.objective.craft_furnace=Craft a furnace.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.objective.craft_chest=Craft a chest for spare supplies.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.journal.10=The trail has taught me that a camp is more than a place to sleep. I need stone, storage, and a hearth before I can settle anywhere for long.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.stone_and_shelter.journal.20=My camp now has the bones of a proper shelter: a place for supplies and a furnace for warmth and work.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.title=Path of the Survivalist: Food for the Road
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.description=No trail is safe on an empty stomach. A careful wanderer learns to hunt, harvest, and keep enough food for the next day.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.objective.gather_wheat=Gather 6 wheat.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.objective.hunt_animals=Hunt 2 animals for meat.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.objective.craft_bread=Bake 2 loaves of bread.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.journal.10=My supplies will not last forever. I need food that can carry me beyond the next hill.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.food_for_the_road.journal.20=I have gathered enough food to keep moving, and I have learned to waste less of what the wilds provide.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.title=Path of the Survivalist: Tools of the Trail
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.description=Good tools are quiet companions. The axe, the pick, and the blade each answer a different danger on the road.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.objective.craft_stone_axe=Craft a stone axe.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.objective.craft_stone_pickaxe=Craft a stone pickaxe.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.objective.craft_stone_sword=Craft a stone sword.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.objective.gather_coal=Gather 8 coal.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.journal.10=The road is easier with tools made for the task. I should prepare the essentials before I travel farther.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.tools_of_the_trail.journal.20=With stone tools and coal in my pack, I am better prepared for hard ground, dark places, and sudden trouble.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.title=Path of the Survivalist: Under Open Sky
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.description=Even the hardiest traveler must rest. A bedroll, spare wool, and a few comforts can turn a dangerous night into a quiet one.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.objective.gather_wool=Gather 3 wool.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.objective.craft_bed=Make a bed for the trail.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.journal.10=A good camp must be ready before exhaustion sets in. I should gather wool and prepare a place to sleep.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.under_open_sky.journal.20=I have made a bed for the road. Rest will come easier now, even far from walls and inns.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.title=Path of the Survivalist: Night Watch
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.description=The wilds do not sleep when the sun goes down. A survivalist learns to hear the dark and answer before it reaches the firelight.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.objective.craft_bow=Craft a bow.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.objective.gather_arrows=Gather 8 arrows.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.objective.defend_camp=Drive off 3 hostile creatures.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.objective.gather_bones=Gather 2 bones as proof of the watch.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.journal.10=The night brings teeth, claws, and worse. I should prepare a weapon that keeps danger at a distance.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.journal.20=I have made a bow and arrows. Now I must prove I can hold the camp through the night.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.night_watch.journal.30=The camp survived the dark. I am beginning to understand the patience and caution of the survivalist path.

quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.title=Path of the Survivalist: Keeper of the Trail
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.description=The final lesson is not about surviving one night, but being ready for many. A true survivalist carries food, light, tools, and direction.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.objective.carry_food=Pack 6 pieces of lasting food.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.objective.carry_torches=Pack 16 torches.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.objective.craft_compass=Craft a compass for the road ahead.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.objective.craft_fishing_rod=Craft a fishing rod for lean days.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.objective.gather_fish=Catch or gather 2 fish.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.journal.10=The path has taught me many small habits. Now I should prepare a pack that can carry me through a long and uncertain journey.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.journal.20=I have gathered a traveler's kit worthy of the road. Wherever I go next, I will not go unprepared.
quest.losttales.path.survivalist.keeper_of_the_trail.journal.30=I have completed the first lessons of the survivalist path. The wilds are still dangerous, but they no longer feel unknowable.

